# The credits text (the CreditsText module of the game, scripts/scorer/creditstext.py): the scorer item that shows one
# page of the credits, made by CreditsText.CreditsScorer (src/game/Script/CreditsText.c), which then empties its
# MAX_TEXT_LINES lines. The format is described in src/game/Script/Script.c. A pack in mods/ with
# scrapc/menus/credits.def replaces this file.

section CreditsScorer
item Credits Credits
	Font %CreditsText.TextFont
	Effect Outline
	Align Left
	Red 160
	Green 160
	Blue 255
	Alpha 255
	X 6
	Y 30
	Visible 0
